    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The townsite required masonry homes, attached garages, and minimum construction costs to ensure quality.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lathrup_Village%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Original covenants barred sale of homes to African American families, reflecting mid‑20th‑century white flight.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lathrup_Village%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1998, much of Lathrup Village was listed on the National Register as the Historic District.",
